How to build GCP image
1. download couchbase-server debian package. i.e. couchbase-server-enterprise_7.2.5-7565-linux_amd64.deb
2. download agents as:
   agents/amd64/dp-agent.gz
   agents/amd64/dp-backup.gz
   agents/amd64/dp-observer.gz
3. create .env based on .env.example
4. packer build couchbase-server.pkr.hcl
